  "description": "SyncProtobuf provides ISyncManager implementations for reading and writing the Protocol Buffers wire format with Loyc.SyncLib, a simple, flexible serialization/deserialization framework in which a single \"synchronizer\" function can both read and write the serialized form of a type. The output is standard, valid Protocol Buffers that can be parsed by any Protobuf implementation (such as protoc-generated code or protobuf-net), and a matching .proto schema can be generated automatically.",
